Package: backyardWTC
Title: Explore Stopped Runners at the 2026 Backyard Ultra Championships
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joshua", "Bannon", email = "jban0020@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Contains a dataset of stopped runners from the 2026 Backyard
    Ultra World Team Championships. Provides functions for summarising
    runner performance across nations and competition classes, alongside
    an interactive Shiny application for exploring the results.
